 file. Including the following fields (indexed with the specified strings)  \"magicNumber\" -- PCAP magic number \"majorVersion\"   -- PCAP file major version number \"minorVersion\" -- PCAP minor version number \"thisZone\" -- PCAP time zone (GMT to local correction) \"sigFigs\" -- accuracy of timestamps \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":219103,"global_rank":233201},{"name":"jiyoonhi/servingbot","owner":"jiyoonhi","html_url":"https://github.com/jiyoonhi/servingbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219102,"global_rank":233222},{"name":"Es7evam/SSC5723-gpso4","owner":"Es7evam","html_url":"https://github.com/Es7evam/SSC5723-gpso4","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Operating Systems Assignements Repository","topics":[],"score":219097,"global_rank":233267},{"name":"alevenberg/simple-avro-example","owner":"alevenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/alevenberg/simple-avro-example","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219093,"global_rank":233301},{"name":"micibr/rf-swtiches","owner":"micibr","html_url":"https://github.com/micibr/rf-swtiches","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219084,"global_rank":233346},{"name":"JoeHowarth/Flecs-Gather-Wood","owner":"JoeHowarth","html_url":"https:/